    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your sword! Cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own camp and defeat all the enemies who dare to challenge you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lightweight strategy game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053290/extras/a9b746b21932a38d1213646239b1776b.avif?t=1746792077\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Compared to classic strategy games,  leans more towards a lightweight experience: no complex economic systems, no need for lightning-fast screen switching, no intricate controls, and no formation planning. All you need to do is lead your cats to defeat the enemies, and use the gems you earn to summon more cats or build arrow towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Match your troops and heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053290/extras/1e93beccdc6868e1063ca6fe229591b3.avif?t=1746792077\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>There are significant differences in stats between units with different roles. Better combinations of units will help you better handle incoming enemies. Also, keep in mind that the hero characters on both sides and their skills will greatly influence the outcome of the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw your sword! Cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own camp and defeat all the enemies who dare to challenge you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lightweight strategy game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053290/extras/a9b746b21932a38d1213646239b1776b.avif?t=1746792077\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Compared to classic strategy games,  leans more towards a lightweight experience: no complex economic systems, no need for lightning-fast screen switching, no intricate controls, and no formation planning. All you need to do is lead your cats to defeat the enemies, and use the gems you earn to summon more cats or build arrow towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Match your troops and heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3053290/extras/1e93beccdc6868e1063ca6fe229591b3.avif?t=1746792077\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>There are significant differences in stats between units with different roles. Better combinations of units will help you better handle incoming enemies. Also, keep in mind that the hero characters on both sides and their skills will greatly influence the outcome of the game.</p>",
